OpMemberDecorate %Counters 1 Offset 4
OpDecorate %Counters BufferBlock
OpDecorate %cnt DescriptorSet 0
OpDecorate %cnt Binding 2
OpDecorate %gl_WorkGroupSize BuiltIn WorkgroupSize
